  "task": "Using the official Wikimedia Pageviews API response for the English Wikipedia article Apollo 11 from 2025-01-01 through 2025-01-07, report each date's daily view count, calculate the seven-day total, and identify the date with the highest count and that count.\n\nStopping condition: Stop after all seven date-count pairs, their calculated total, and the highest-view date and count have been recorded.\n\nConstraints:\n- Use only the items returned by the supplied official API response.\n- Convert each returned daily timestamp only to its YYYY-MM-DD date; do not change timezone or aggregate a different interval.\n- Show the arithmetic used for the total and maximum selection.\n- Preserve all view counts as exact integers.",
